                <p>Leisure, recreation, years, leisure is important for the health of people with disabilities as well. "There should never be any barriers to recreation, there are always ways to adapt an activity so a person can do it!" she states emphatically. A person may have to change how they complete a leisure activity using a different method, or using special equipment, but it can be done—from hunting and fishing to A-Z.</p>
